"# Luxury Cleaning Service\n## Safest Non Toxic Cookware, Best Pots and Pans for Home Health\n\n[Safest Non Toxic Cookware, Best Pots and Pans for Home Health](https://www.dustpanandbrush.com.au/post/safest-non-toxic-cookware-pots-and-pans-for-the-home)\n## What is Oxygen Bleach and is it Safe? Better Laundry Alternatives\n\n[What is Oxygen Bleach and is it Safe? Better Laundry Alternatives](https://www.dustpanandbrush.com.au/post/what-is-oxygen-bleach-and-is-it-safe)\n## Mattress Allergies? Get Rid of Dust Mites, Sanitise for Clean Sleep\n\n[Mattress Allergies? Get Rid of Dust Mites, Sanitise for Clean Sleep](https://www.dustpanandbrush.com.au/post/mattress-allergies-dust-mites)\n## Mid Century Modern Furniture; Melbourne’s Style Obsession\n\n[Mid Century Modern Furniture; Melbourne’s Style Obsession](https://www.dustpanandbrush.com.au/post/mid-century-modern-melbourne)\n## Professionalism : Reliability\n\nOffering considered cleaning services beyond typical; detailed, premium cleaning for stately spaces. Our boutique cleaning service in Melbourne is artisan-delivered to meet your needs and return breath to your routine. Providing unique touches and comprehensive services customised to requirement.\n\nOur private cleaning service returns to you what is most valuable; time and peace of mind. Enquire to discuss breadth and scope of work, as well as any additional inclusions needed such as mattress sanitisation, organic cleanse, chandelier dusting, pool glass cleaning, wellness space refreshment, gym cleaning, theatre room cleaning, soft stone and precious metal maintenance, wine cellar and humidor care, cast iron seasoning, outdoor maintenance and more. Details are handled with precision and care, ensuring your internal and external environment remains pristine and your lifestyle remains uninterrupted.\n## Your needs & our service\n\n[Dustpan & Brush](https://www.dustpanandbrush.com.au/) is experienced in cleaning luxury homes and manses in Melbourne, primarily located in Toorak, Kew, Hawthorn, and Surrey Hills. We may be able to assist other localities subject to availability and capacity. Please feel free to contact us if you'd like to know more about who we are, and for availability and serviceability.\n\nWe take pride in our work, communication and exceptional quality. We are not an agency with hundreds of contracted staff. We are a boutique, minimally staffed offering, maintaining consistency in people, trustworthiness & purpose. As may be assumed based on the above, we are in high demand throughout the year - while we are always attempting to assist where able, we encourage you please enquire for information and scheduling capacity.\n\nWe emphasize that we are not an au pair or live-in housekeeping service; rather, we excel in delivering meticulous and superior cleaning solutions, as often as needed, tailored to busy lifestyles in homes seeking dedicated reliability. At your introductory booking, please feel free to ask about our care routine; soft stone & travertine maintenance, bronze faucets, marble kitchens, black japan hardwood etc. We have a decade of experience and are happy to impart our knowledge.\n### Premium Organic Cleaning\n\nBeyond providing a private cleaning service in Melbourne, we also care for the little details that matter; we're entirely eco-friendly, we make all our own organic cleaning products by hand, we are [100% carbon neutral](https://www.dustpanandbrush.com.au/sustainability), our bank contributes zero funding to fossil fuel projects/industries, and all run on 100% renewable energy in kind.\n\nFurther, we have teamed up with One Tree Planted, working to restore bushfire affected areas through regenerative biodiversity projects. For each new clean delivered, a new tree is planted on your behalf.​\n\n'Nature is not a place to visit.\n\nIt is home.'\n\nGary Snyder\n\nMelbourne Eco Cleaner\n\n© Dustpan & Brush Est. 2016\n\n0492 939 860\n\nAll Rights Reserved\n\n[terms of service + privacy policy](